@@ -5162,12 +5237,13 @@ entries:
     place: tianjin
     thread: china-leadership
     c: 'Tianjin 天津. Deng Xiaoping 邓小平 chairs the plenary of the Tianjin meeting on Mao''s seventeen questions. Urban communes: the city''s wage system, a policy needed; reports in the press to be true to fact. Mao Zedong Thought 毛泽东思想 vulgarized; Marxism–Leninism little spoken of; the two not to be split; Mao the representative of the collective leadership, a member of it. Trusts: faster growth and full use.'
